      "text": "NLRP3 inflammasome activation in microglia, which \u03b1-synuclein can drive, is a neuroinflammation target in PD. Early NLRP3 inhibitor studies of NT-0796 and selnoflast were short safety and biomarker studies, not efficacy trials. The VENT-02 registry record is TERMINATED. Minocycline and azathioprine did not meet efficacy goals, and a review says selecting participants by inflammatory phenotype could potentially enhance success.",
